                            <comment id="16796975" author="pkouznet" created="Wed, 20 Mar 2019 09:53:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented tests for the parameters.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Currently there is no bug. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s see the example:&lt;br/&gt;
if we got update query: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;UPDATE&lt;/span&gt; PARAMS &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;SET&lt;/span&gt; VAL1 = ?, VAL2 = ? &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt; ID = ?
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;it is internally transformed to: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;UPDATE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;PUBLIC&lt;/span&gt;.PARAMS
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;SET&lt;/span&gt;
VAL1 = ?1,
    VAL2 = ?2
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt; ID = ?3
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;and we generate select statement for it:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-sql&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;SELECT&lt;/span&gt;
_KEY,
_VAL,
?1 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;AS&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;_upd_VAL1&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&quot;,
?2 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;AS&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;_upd_VAL2&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&quot;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;PUBLIC&lt;/span&gt;.PARAMS
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt; ID = ?3
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16797063" author="pkouznet" created="Wed, 20 Mar 2019 11:21:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt; could you please take a look at the patch?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
